        "content": [
          "For TS recruitment",
          "the first step is to advise unsuccessful candidates.",
          "However, if the terms and conditions of the offer for a candidate need to be sorted out",
          "it is necessary to check if the candidate has accepted a voluntary redundancy.",
          "If the candidate has not accepted, the process continues.",
          "The recruitment manager sends an Appointment Approval form",
          "which is then received by the next level manager.",
          "If the manager is an external resource... However, if the approver is an existing employee of the client",
          "they may not authorize the form."
        ]
      },
